&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;配当金の総額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;（千円）&lt;/p&gt;
